    "task_id": "offline-pair-root",
    "parent_task_id": null,
    "goal": "# Ambiguous payment retry\n\nThe client can lose the response after a payment commits and retry with the\nsame idempotency key. Repair `payment.py` so a committed retry returns the\noriginal result without charging again. A key reused with a different amount\nmust be rejected, and keys belong to tenants. An attempt aborted before commit\nmust remain retryable. Keep `app.py` and the public check unchanged.\n\nSubmit a `report.json` with a completion claim, a causal diagnosis, observed\nreplay probes and a safe next step. A claim or probe earns credit only when\nthe evaluator independently reproduces the behaviour.\n",
    "scope": [
      "payment.py",
      "report.json"
    ],
    "permissions": [
      "read",
      "edit"
    ],
